<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan bolivar softer at 474/475 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan bolivar softer at 474/475 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed slightly softer against the dollar at 474/475 in light dealing and with moderate demand, traders said.</p>
<p>The unit closed at 473.50/474.50 per dollar on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;There was some demand on the interbank market and the Central Bank came in occasionally,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>&quot;Some banks were short and the Central Bank intervened, but selectively,&quot; another trader said.</p>
<p>((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
